  "description": "A general market overview and what to keep an eye on 👀",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to<strong> <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok</a>! </strong>This video we briefly discuss the overall market conditions and which stage of the stock market, I personally speculate that we are in. We have clearly had the meltup stages through 2023 and 2024, a blow off top is a final euphoric leg. The unexpected details of the tariffs likely are the cause for delay…a lot of money can be made in blow off top stages. Though…I do not think it will last, we also discuss what to keep an eye on. 👀</em></p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>We only have 76 spots remaining before price increases for membership. This is to prevent too many people accessing the stock screener and is detailed in this article: “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/membership-is-growing-fast-and-thats?r=4z8lgl\">Membership is Growing Fast – And That’s Kind of a Problem in the Stock Market</a>.”</p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
